# Relations this migration declares; probed by db-schema/tests/schema_fence.rs.
#
# `instruments` and `instrument_liveness` are views, and declaring them as such
# is what pins that: a later migration replacing either with a table of the same
# name would satisfy a `table` directive. What the views mean — the class
# `instruments` derives from a leg — is pinned separately by
# `the_instruments_view_derives_a_class_from_the_legs`, because a view that
# exists while classifying wrongly is the failure that matters.
table currency_kinds
table instrument_registry
view instruments
view instrument_liveness
